  "description": "Rent365 Ltd offers this beautiful three bedroom unfurnished house to let immediately The property is in excellent condition and is available on a first letting. The house is situated in the Janeville development within a short walk of Carrigaline town centre and close to access road to Cork city. \nThe accommodation consists of a large living room to the front of the house. There is a large kitchen dining room with a separate utility room. Upstairs there is three bedrooms two double and one single. There is parking to the front and a good sized walled in garden to the rear. \nFor viewing please contact John Lyons on 086 8349403. ",
